WEBVTT

00:04:27.236 --> 00:04:31.716
and that we stay in chronic
fight or flight mode,

00:04:31.756 --> 00:04:35.236
that our bodies have this chronic stress,

00:04:35.276 --> 00:04:38.556
chronic levels of inflammation

00:04:38.596 --> 00:04:43.636
and circulating stress hormones
that wear away our happiness

00:04:43.676 --> 00:04:46.876
and break down different body systems.

00:04:48.996 --> 00:04:53.316
Well, what kinds of relationships
seem essential to well-being?

00:04:55.116 --> 00:04:56.436
And this is interesting.

00:04:56.476 --> 00:04:59.156
We asked people

00:04:59.156 --> 00:05:02.636
who were our original
participants in our study.